<name>Meter &amp; Gauge System</name>
<para id="RM0000005A500YX" category="J" type-id="300N2" name-id="630WS-00" from="200612">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>Speedometer Malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM0000005A500YX_07" type-id="33" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000B4100000">
<name>Function Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The combination meter assembly receives the vehicle speed signal from the ABS &amp; traction actuator assembly via CAN communication. The combination meter assembly drives the speedometer based on the received vehicle speed signal.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<ptxt>Even when the speedometer is normal, there may be a difference between the indicated value and the actual vehicle speed. 2 factors can be considered as causes of this error. One is external factors due to tire size, tire inflation pressure and tire wear. The other is internal factors due to the tolerance of the indicated value. Therefore, when troubleshooting, first check whether these factors are having an effect. Visually check the external factors: tire size, tire pressure and wear (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000VNQ00LX"/>). In addition, check the internal factor, the allowable range of the indicated value, using a speedometer tester (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000IU4017X_01_0002"/>).</ptxt>
</atten3>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000005A500YX_04" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000004X00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B162456J01" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000005A500YX_05" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000B4200000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten3>
<ptxt>If the vehicle speed indication inspection result is out of tolerance, perform the inspection using a speedometer tester. (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000IU4017X_01_0002"/>)</ptxt>
</atten3>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM0000005A500YX_06" type-id="01" category="01">
